## 3. Core Library — `src/lib/blog.ts`

All data-fetching for the blog route lives here. Has an in-memory cache
(`BlogCache`, 1hr TTL) keyed by function+args — call `clearBlogCache()` after
bulk content changes if testing locally without restart.

| Function | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `getAllBlogPosts()` | Returns all posts as `BlogMetadata[]`, recursively scanned, sorted by date desc |
| `getBlogPost(slug)` | Returns single full `BlogPost` (with compiled `content` HTML/MDX), resolves slug across subfolders |
| `getAllBlogSlugs()` | All bare slugs (filenames w/o ext) |
| `getPostsByCategory(categorySlug)` | Filter by `category` frontmatter |
| `getAllCategories()` | Hardcoded list: Seasonal, Trends, Tutorial, Nail Care, Nail Art, Editor's Choice |
| `getRelatedPosts(slug, limit=12)` | Priority: 1) same pillar family 2) same `topic` 3) most recent fallback |
| `getPaginatedPosts(page, perPage=12)` | Simple pagination over all posts |
| `getAllClusters()` | Groups all pillar posts with their cluster children → `{pillar, clusters}[]` |
| `getStandalonePosts()` | Posts with no pillar/cluster `topicalMap.position` |
| `getPillarClusterPosts(pillarSlug)` | Single pillar + its clusters (used by `PillarHub`) |
| `extractBodyImages(html, heroImage)` | Pulls `<img>` src list from post HTML, excludes hero image — powers "Download images" button |
| `injectInspoGalleryLinks(html, topic)` | Auto-inserts a link to `/inspo/{topic}-inspiration-gallery` after every `<img>` in **`.md`** posts only (MDX handled separately via `MDXContent.tsx`'s `img` component override) |
| `clearBlogCache()` | Wipes the cache |

Slug resolution (`resolveFilePath`): tries flat file first, then recursively
searches subfolders matching either full relative slug or bare filename.
Prefers `.mdx` over `.md` if both exist.

