## 4. Page: `src/app/blog/page.tsx` (listing page)

- `generateStaticParams` not used here (dynamic query params instead: `?page=`, `?category=`)
- `buildPageAllocation(targetPage)` — the core pagination algorithm:
  - `CLUSTERS_PER_PAGE = 3` clusters consumed per page (1 → hero, 2 → carousels)
  - `HERO_TARGET_COUNT = 12` posts in hero section (pillar family topped up with standalone posts if short, overflow queued if long)
  - `MUST_READ_COUNT = 3`, `LATEST_EDITS_PER_PAGE = 6` — pulled from remaining standalone/overflow pool
  - Tracks `usedSlugs` to avoid duplicate posts across sections/pages
  - Returns `hasNextPage` bool for pagination
- If `?category=` present → separate simpler branch: `getPostsByCategory` + flat 12/page pagination, skips all cluster logic
- Section order: Hero title → `BlogCategoryNav` → `InlineNewsletter` → `MainHeroSection` → `CarouselSection` (cluster 1) → `MustReadSection` → `InlineNewsletter` → `CarouselSection` (cluster 2) → `LatestStoriesSection` → `NextPageButton`

