## 8. SEO Helper — `src/lib/seo.ts`

`generatePageMetadata(input: PageMetadataInput)` — generic metadata builder
used by **other** pages (not directly used by the blog post route, which has
its own `buildPostMetadata` inline in `[...slug]/page.tsx`). Useful if
standardizing blog metadata generation later.

Also exports: `generateImageAlt`, `calculateReadTime`, `optimizeTitle`,
`optimizeDescription`, `validateSlug`, `generateSlug`.

