## 9. Breadcrumbs — `src/lib/breadcrumbs.ts`

`generateBreadcrumbs(pathname)`, `slugToTitle(slug)` (has a `CATEGORY_LABELS`
map for nicer names), `getBlogBreadcrumbs(postSlug)` (currently just returns
`[{Blog, /blog}]`), `getTopicBreadcrumbs(topic)`. Note: the actual rendered
breadcrumb in templates is built inline (`<Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Blog',href:'/blog'}]} currentPage={post.title}/>`), not via these helpers.

