## 10. Content Validation — `src/lib/contentValidation.ts`

Not wired into the route at request time — a standalone QA tool.
`validatePost(content, frontmatter, primaryKeyword, lsiKeywords)` → checks
word count (min 1500, target 2000-3000), keyword density/count, LSI keyword
usage, H2 keyword presence, image alt-text keyword coverage, internal/external
link counts, required frontmatter fields. `generateSEOReport(validation)`
formats results as text. Likely run manually/via script before publishing.

