## 11. Types — `src/types/blog.ts`

- `BlogMetadata` — lightweight, used in listings/cards (no `content`)
- `BlogPost` — full post incl. `content`, `isMDX`, `coverImage` (required)
- `TopicalMap` — pillar/cluster metadata shape (see §2)
- `Product` — `{ image, name/title, price, link/url, brand?, details? }`
- `TLDR` — `{ summary: string[], tldrFaqs?, creativeLine?, keyTakeaways? }`
- `NavigationContext` — prev/next/pillar post refs (optional, in frontmatter)
- `FAQ` — `{ question, answer }`
- Imports `FAQItem, TutorialStep, VideoMetadata` from `generateSchemas.ts`

