## 12. Common Edit Recipes

- **Add a new post**: drop `.md`/`.mdx` file into `src/content/blogs/` (flat or
  subfolder), set frontmatter (`title, excerpt, date, author, image, template`
  at minimum). No code changes needed — `generateStaticParams` picks it up.
- **Add a new topic/pillar family**: set `topic` on all related posts, mark
  one post `topicalMap.position: 'pillar'`, others `'cluster'` with
  `topicalMap.parentPillar` = pillar's slug.
- **Change hero pagination counts on `/blog`**: edit constants at top of
  `src/app/blog/page.tsx` (`CLUSTERS_PER_PAGE`, `HERO_TARGET_COUNT`,
  `MUST_READ_COUNT`, `LATEST_EDITS_PER_PAGE`).
- **Add/remove a section on post pages**: edit the relevant template file(s)
  in `src/app/blog/templates/` — remember to mirror changes across all 4
  templates' shared tail sections if the change should apply universally.
- **Change product grid embedding syntax**: `renderContentWithProducts()` in
  each template, regex `{{PRODUCTS:count:indices}}`.
- **Change JSON-LD output**: `src/lib/generateSchemas.ts`.
- **Change what counts as "related posts"**: `getRelatedPosts()` in `blog.ts`.
- **Bug: post 404s**: check `resolveFilePath()` slug matching in `blog.ts`,
  and confirm topic segment (if 2-segment URL) matches frontmatter `topic`.
